  "raw": " something powerful enough.\"\nDr Gideon Rickman. The Mountain Clan acquired her perfected systems from Pandora when they abducted him back on Requiem for Rights. Thanks to Pandora's scientific genius she was able to deamonstrate parts of her invention that allowed them to infiltrate Pandora, and create talented clones across multiple cities who could remotely control all technology within tens of miles distance (which combined with Reeves Day she dubbed crux domes). From this base Dr Gideon created countless super soldiers, several of which escaped Pandora with items related to her being developed by Jonathan Nolan's group (many of which were used by directors like Paul Verhoeven). She would blackmail Tobias' family into funding her. As multiple groups pursued what she considered murder plot against Pandora under Sen Yin using her ships, one faction at Starfleet Academy was able to figure out what crux dom were being sent and refused to let her operate with their equipment, taking her in hand-to-hand combat training unable to learn to rely on any systems",
